cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, protocol, or any of its tables, please cite it as below."
title: "Kronos vs AlphaZeroBeta: A Controlled, Leakage-Free Comparison of a Financial Foundation Model and a Reinforcement-Learning Portfolio Agent"
abstract: >-
  A controlled, leakage-free walk-forward benchmark comparing a financial
  K-line foundation model (Kronos, zero-shot) with a CNN-GRU recurrent-PPO
  market-neutral portfolio agent (AlphaZeroBeta), evaluated on the S&P 500
  over 22 out-of-sample folds spanning 2014-2024 under identical universes,
  costs and portfolio constraints. Includes a partial independent reproduction
  of the published AlphaZeroBeta results with all deviations documented.
